  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following statements is incorrect?<br />\r(i) In octahedral complexes, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals posses low energy as compared to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals<br />\r(ii) In octahedral complexes, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals possess low energy as compared to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals<br />\r(iii) In tetrahedral complexes, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals posses high energy as compared to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbitals"
